MicroOS changed its classes.dex: NavigationBar.getBarLayoutParamsForRotation,
NavigationBarView.updateCurrentRotation and the WM Shell
DisplayLayout.recalcInsets put the 3 button navigation bar on the right edge
in landscape. 0001-navbar-right-in-landscape.patch in the source RPM is the
change. MicroOS signed the changed APK with the AOSP test platform key.
